# Captured evidence behind the docs in .knowledge/. These are genuinely log files
# (concatenated JSON objects, CLI console output), so the *.log rule above would
# otherwise drop them. Nested un-ignore, since a bare directory rule does not
# re-include files a pattern already excluded.
!evidence/**/*.log
